   "daf": "63b",
   "sentenceId": 1,
   "he": "וּכְמִין צְמַרְמוֹרוֹת וְכוּ׳. ״וְכֵן כַּיּוֹצֵא בָּהֶן״ — לְאֵתוֹיֵי מַאי? אָמַר רַבָּה בַּר עוּלָּא: לְאֵתוֹיֵי אִשָּׁה שֶׁרֹאשָׁהּ כָּבֵד עָלֶיהָ, וְאֵבָרֶיהָ כְּבֵדִים עָלֶיהָ, וְרוֹתֶתֶת, וְגוֹסָה.",
   "en": "The mishna teaches: «Or a type of» feverish «shuddering» overtakes her, «and likewise» the same applies with regard to any sensation «of the like.» The Gemara asks: «What is added» by this last phrase? «Rabba bar Ulla said:» It serves «to include a woman whose head is heavy upon her or her limbs are heavy upon her, or she trembles or belches» constantly."
  }
 ],
